0..77 Comment "// Renaming twice is renaming once, the renaming case of the fusion lemmas of"
78..154 Comment "// Allais et al. (_A type- and scope-safe universe of syntaxes with binding:"
155..230 Comment "// their semantics and proofs_, JFP 2021, doi:10.1017/S0956796820000076): a"
231..301 Comment "// term renamed by `a1` then `a2` is the term renamed by `a3` when the"
302..378 Comment "// lookups agree at every index, and likewise for two composites. Each is an"
379..454 Comment "// induction on the term whose hypothesis is the pointwise one, lifted once"
455..522 Comment "// under each abstraction; an application\'s two paths are joined by"
523..538 Comment "// `transport`."
540..585 Comment "// The naturals; the syntax; the congruences."
